      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
        Income Verification &amp; Financial Solvency: €3,500/Month Net Proof Protocol
      </h2>
      <p>
        The Greek Ministry of Migration and Asylum enforces rigorous solvency benchmarks under Joint Ministerial Decision 14826/2021. To qualify, you must prove uninterrupted access to recurring stable income generated exclusively outside Greece:
      </p>
