          Upon arrival with your Type D Visa, visit the local Tax Office (<em>DOY</em>) or submit an electronic application through the AADE myTAXISnet portal. You will receive an <strong>AFM (Arithmos Forologikou Mitroou)</strong> and key codes (<em>Kleidarithmos</em>) to activate digital government portals.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Biometric Data Capture &amp; Veveosi Receipt Issuance</strong>:
